# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
out/
native-build/
release/
*.tsbuildinfo
# NOTE: deliberately no bare `build/` entry here. electron-builder's own convention
# (see apps/desktop/electron-builder.yml's `buildResources: build`) uses a *source*
# directory literally named build/ for tracked packaging assets (app icons,
# entitlements.mac.plist) — apps/desktop/build/ is the only build/ directory in this
# repo, and a bare pattern would (and, until this fix, silently did) make git treat
# those required-for-packaging files as untracked/ignored forever. If a real generated
# build/ output directory is ever introduced elsewhere, scope its ignore entry to that
# exact path instead of reintroducing a bare `build/`.

# .NET build output — scoped to this exact path. A bare `bin/`/`obj/` pattern would
# also swallow the tracked, vendored packages/adapter-macos/vendor/mediaremote-adapter/bin/
# script (and any future package's legitimate bin/ directory, e.g. an npm "bin" entry).
packages/adapter-windows/native/SmtcHelper/bin/
packages/adapter-windows/native/SmtcHelper/obj/

